// DeployAxSecurity deploys axsecurity to a server.
// Automatically detects and removes any existing agent before deploying.
// 1. Auto-cleanup: stop old service, remove old binary/unit/data
// 2. Requests backend to build per-server binary (force=true)
// 3. Downloads binary from one-time R2 link
// 4. Uploads binary + install script to server via SSH
// 5. Executes install script with KEK
